b.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104446","id":2744665470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jmEV-","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T23:21:40Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T23:21:40Z","body":"This is a duplicate of #74452. As mentioned there (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74452#issuecomment-1455214688) changing the return type would break compatibility.\n\nThe issue was resolved by documenting this quirk (in #76107).\n\n```\n[b]Note:[/b] This function actually takes a [code]uint32_t[/code], so C# users should use [code]uint32.MaxValue[/code] instead of [code]-1[/code] to produce a mesh with flat normals. \n```\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711/doc/classes/SurfaceTool.xml#L248-L254\n\nI don't see anything more to be done here, hence closing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744665470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]